| 5 | 240 |
| 6 | 1440 |

| original three-share indices | actual reconstructed secret | actual modular products |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
| `[0, 1, 2]` | 1234 | 66 |
| `[0, 2, 4]` | 1234 | 66 |
| `[1, 3, 5]` | 1234 | 66 |
| `[2, 4, 5]` | 1234 | 66 |

Two-share interpolant at zero is 1046, which does not certify the original threshold.
